OL,3,GNEWSAWaterfront plans move step closer
OL,4,Aafter backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to make a seafront area a more
OL,7,Fattractive place to spend time have
OL,8,Fmoved a step closer after politicians
OL,9,Fbacked a series of improvement
OL,10,Fprojects.
OL,12,FThe Guernsey Development Agency (GDA)
OL,13,Fhas been given the go-ahead by senior
OL,14,FStates members to start developing
OL,15,Fdetailed plans for a package of
OL,16,Fshort-term projects at St Sampson
OL,17,FHarbour and The Bridge.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
