OL,3,GNEWSAWaterfront plans move step closer
OL,4,Aafter backing
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals include new waterfront
OL,7,Fwalking and cycling routes, a sheltered
OL,8,Fbus station, improvements to The Bridge
OL,9,Fretail area and a family-friendly space
OL,10,Fwith a children's play area and cafe.
OL,12,FSimon Kildahl, non-executive director
OL,13,Fof the GDA, said the area had the
OL,14,Fpotential to become a destination in
OL,15,Fits own right.
